This is to simple dialog to add a listing to the app store.

This Dialog Will Provide You With Additionional Details About A Product You Want To Submit.
The User Will Be presented with an area where they can compose a description of their listing
Followed by a Area for rating and review of the listing.

WHEN COMPLETE THE INFORMATION WILL BE submitted and feel to iTunes Connect.

